<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US troops have completed their withdrawal, leaving Iraq to confront new security and governance challenges while Gulf states rank higher in disaster resilience than Iraq. Baghdad and Tehran are deepening security cooperation and have activated joint committees, even as Iran’s envoy warned that border security is a red line and Iranian forces attacked the Komala Kurdish opposition group. Iraqi authorities are pursuing legal action against media incitement supporting pro-Iran armed groups, arresting a lawyer who brandished a gun in court and urging prosecutions, while the YBŞ is negotiating integration into state security institutions. Nineveh continues heritage reconstruction and the Jordanian king has invited the Iraqi president for regional de-escalation talks. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNUjZoclRLVTlObk1aWTlscEhLSnZyOURudDUxd1plSEJRS2Roc3dRYjdqaVB0TWVPaHVodlZ1RmVESE1ZbXRxVlVpYUZwbmFScF84am02N1RCSERCUkQ2ZFQzX2ZuTXZfVjk0ZTdjMmcydUw2RkV4VVFjR3lObXdsNGZMb2lNcHp5ek1FNVM1dWMtOTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPSmNrWTFFN2lLR1VlNkozckJlRlZzQVlHVFA4NEpFaEJkOE1BS2NvVDl5UW01MUc5Unp3U1dVWTU4XzVlNFFQdmVORm1DVEYzYzBkeEgtMHdpLVc0SVBGQl9JeWtoU2VNbVNudzZ0dDdMZ0RxQjJpdHlCanpXeFEtUDBhZVN1WlM4VlkyTHA3TldNZEhReXZudXVBR2dRWkh3eFJNdFhDLXhYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE81NGdrMFIzZk9NWWZWTE90VU5tMUVNbVp5MGJfcE5BcHpHT25UVHVRdE42YmJ3MUhpZ08tQjZVb1BkaGpiOFRzazU5S0s?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPUVNzeVBfY2V5NnhvdnpvT01LN0NVTUFnQ0lnSEwwSWYyZnV4dUxDVEl2LTdzeGp4bGtYVkN2cHlzT0dLX3NvekZaVVJ3Q1ZGQ3c3N09hUFBYN